\paragraph{Backward Compatibility}

Users may have sessions saved before we added query-provider pairs. These old
session files lack the [[query_provider_pairs]] field entirely. Rather than
failing to load or losing information, we reconstruct reasonable pairs from the
existing [[query]] and [[providers]] fields. This assumes the same query was
used for all providers---which was true before this feature existed---and
preserves session usability without requiring manual migration.

